{"id":"karriere","lemma":"Karriere","pos":"noun","rank":1270,"glosses":["career (occupational path)","quick or steep occupational advancement"],"ipa":"/kaˈri̯eːrə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f4/De-Karriere2.ogg/De-Karriere2.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Karriere","plural":"Karrieren"},"examples":[{"text":"Meine Karriere steht auf dem Spiel.","en":"My career is on the line.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"a game"}]},{"text":"Meine Familie ist mir wichtiger als meine Karriere.","en":"I put my family before my career.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"important","l":"wichtig"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Seine politische Karriere ist beendet.","en":"His political career has ended.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"political","l":"politisch"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"to finish","l":"beenden"}]},{"text":"Der Skandal ruinierte seine Karriere.","en":"The scandal ruined his career.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"scandal"},{"g":"to ruin","l":"ruinieren"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null]},{"text":"Deine Familie sollte dir wichtiger sein als deine Karriere.","en":"Your family should come before your career.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"important","l":"wichtig"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null]}]}